---
layout: layouts/feature.njk
wide: true
title: Administration | Shellui
description: Staff and owners open an embedded admin in the Shellui shell. Manage users, groups, logs, and tokens, then inject your own apps into the sidebar.
eyebrow: Features
heading: Administration in the shell
lede: Staff and company owners open an embedded admin from the account menu. The shell hosts it in an iframe at /admin. You inject extra apps into the sidebar from config.
---

<div class="grid items-start gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16">
  <div class="max-w-2xl">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-3xl">Admin is another iframe, not a second product</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-base/7 text-muted-foreground">The admin UI is a React app. Point <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 text-sm">backend.adminUrl</code> at it (local Vite or <a class="font-medium text-primary-ink underline underline-offset-2 dark:text-primary" href="https://admin.shellui.com">admin.shellui.com</a>) and the shell registers <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 text-sm">/admin</code> for users with <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 text-sm">isStaff</code> or <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 text-sm">isCompanyOwner</code>.</p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-base/7 text-muted-foreground">It talks to the same <a class="font-medium text-primary-ink underline underline-offset-2 dark:text-primary" href="{{ site.identityService }}">identity-service</a> as sign-in. Source lives in the <a class="font-medium text-primary-ink underline underline-offset-2 dark:text-primary" href="{{ site.adminPanel }}">admin</a> repo. Without <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 text-sm">adminPathname</code>, the account menu does not show Administration.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-sm">
    {% include "feature-visual-admin.njk" %}
  </div>
</div>

<div class="mt-10 grid max-w-3xl gap-6 sm:grid-cols-3">
  <div>
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary-ink dark:text-primary">1. Point at the admin app</p>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm/6 text-muted-foreground">Set <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 text-[0.8rem]">adminPathname</code> and <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 text-[0.8rem]">adminUrl</code> on a Shellui identity backend.</p>
  </div>
  <div>
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary-ink dark:text-primary">2. Sign in as staff or owner</p>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm/6 text-muted-foreground">The shell guards the route. Members without those flags never load the iframe.</p>
  </div>
  <div>
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary-ink dark:text-primary">3. Open Administration</p>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm/6 text-muted-foreground">The account menu exposes it. Hash routes inside admin stay in sync with the shell path, such as <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 text-[0.8rem]">/admin/users</code>.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="mt-8 max-w-3xl">
  {% highlight "ts", "shellui.config.ts" %}
import type { ShellUIConfig } from "@shellui/core";

const config: ShellUIConfig = {
  backend: {
    type: "shellui",
    url: "http://localhost:8000",
    companyId: 1,
    adminPathname: "/admin",
    adminUrl: "http://localhost:5174",
    login: {
      methods: ["oauth"],
      oauthProviders: ["github"],
    },
  },
};

export default config;
  {% endhighlight %}
</div>

<section class="mt-16" aria-labelledby="admin-screenshot-slot">
  <h2 id="admin-screenshot-slot" class="sr-only">Admin screenshot slot</h2>
  {% set slotKind = "screenshot" %}
  {% set slotLabel = "Playground /admin users" %}
  {% set slotHint = "16:9 · directory table in host chrome. Not a generated mock." %}
  {% set slotRatio = "video" %}
  {% include "media-slot.njk" %}
</section>

<section class="mt-20" aria-labelledby="directory-surfaces">
  <div class="max-w-2xl">
    <h2 id="directory-surfaces" class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-3xl">Directory, logs, tokens, and files</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-base/7 text-muted-foreground">Identity screens ship with the admin app. Storage screens appear when <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 text-sm">storage.url</code> is set. Staff can open Django admin in a new tab - it is not framed.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 gap-10 md:grid-cols-3 md:gap-6 lg:gap-8">
    <div>
      <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-foreground">Users and organization</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm/6 text-muted-foreground">Directory, enable or disable membership for this company, and the Organization panel for public, domain, or invitation-only join rules.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-foreground">Groups, logs, and tokens</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm/6 text-muted-foreground">Company groups, login events, personal access tokens, and per-company OAuth clients. The same APIs the authentication feature describes.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-foreground">Storage</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm/6 text-muted-foreground">Files explorer and statistics when storage is configured. Swagger and ReDoc for the storage-service sit next to them.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="mt-20" aria-labelledby="custom-admin-nav">
  <div class="max-w-2xl">
    <h2 id="custom-admin-nav" class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-3xl">Your apps in the sidebar</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-base/7 text-muted-foreground">The top-level <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 text-sm">administration</code> block injects a titled section below Dashboard and above Identity. Each item is a <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 text-sm">NavigationItem</code>: the admin chrome loads <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 text-sm">url</code> in an iframe, or opens it in a new tab when the target cannot be framed.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="mt-8 max-w-3xl">
    {% highlight "ts", "shellui.config.ts" %}
const config: ShellUIConfig = {
  administration: {
    title: { en: "Applications", fr: "Applications" },
    navigation: [
      {
        label: { en: "Billing", fr: "Facturation" },
        path: "billing",
        url: "https://billing.example.com/",
        icon: "/icons/billing.svg",
      },
    ],
  },
};
    {% endhighlight %}
  </div>
  {% include "admin-nav-examples.njk" %}
</section>

